al locations crashed many real  cars and use the best real stuntmen he  could find the intention being to make  everything feel realistic gritty and  dangerous and in this age of  computer-generated special  facts that's rare that was your  insider's guide to Mad Max fury road in  theaters May 15 for Fandango movie clips  I'm Alicia Malone fight
 

